From: Luma Developers
Subject: [PATCH] Keycap on-screen keyboard

The shared Keycap design and input tools (Stevia patch 0004) for the
Shell keyboard: token-generated light/dark caps with travel, the tool
strip, clipboard and cursor panels, preferences, sentence case, double
space period, delete and space gestures, privacy for sensitive fields
and Keycap sizing.

